<h2>Thanks, <%= @booking.user.name %></h2>

<p>We have your booking for <strong><%= @course.title %></strong>.</p>

<ul>
  <li>Dates: <%= @schedule.start_date.strftime("%d %b") %> – <%= @schedule.end_date.strftime("%d %b %Y") %></li>
  <li>Participants: <%= @booking.participants %></li>
  <li>Total: <%= number_to_currency(@booking.total_cents / 100.0, unit: "Rp ", delimiter: ".", precision: 0) %></li>
</ul>

<p>
  Your seats are held. We will email you again once an instructor has confirmed
  the dates — nothing is charged until then.
</p>
